<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble falls to 14,600 to dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble falls to 14,600 to dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble slipped to 14,600 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 14,550 on the previous session.</p>
<p>				    September 16	  September 13</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    14,600		  14,550</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $2.899 million	    $3.819 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
